on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [  2] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  3] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [  5] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 9 to 0
  [  7] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  9] extcall 81 .............................. play done
  [ 11] ret
end
